OL,3,GNEWSAWoman found dead in caravan named
OL,4,Aby police
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating the death of a
OL,7,Fwoman whose body was found in a caravan
OL,8,Fhave named her as Susan Lumsden.
OL,10,FNorthamptonshire Police was called to a
OL,11,Fcaravan park on Ecton Lane, Sywell, at
OL,12,Fabout 06:20 BST on Monday following
OL,13,Freports of an assault.
OL,15,FA 72-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,16,Fsuspicion of murder and remains in
OL,17,Fpolice custody.
OL,19,FDet Ch Insp Ryan Catling said officers
OL,20,Fwanted to hear from anyone in the area,
OL,21,Fparticularly in the caravan park, in
OL,22,Fthe hours leading up to the incident.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
